# ENVELOPE model - NOT vendor CAD. OLED module HS13L02B4S01 (LCSC C42432559).
# No vendor 3D model exists for this module (verified 2026-11-16: no EasyEDA
# component for the C-number). Box drawn from the documented body outline only:
# 35.4 x 33.5mm with the header row 2.0mm from the connector-side edge
# (datasheet, via FP_OLED_1P3 in froemix/euro/lib/footprints.tsx).
#
# THIS ENVELOPE IS THE MODULE PCB ONLY (1.6mm). The glass/bezel Z above the PCB
# is NOT vendor-documented (doc/MECHANICAL-STACK.md) and stays a first-article
# measurement - extend the envelope height once the module is measured.
# Origin = footprint origin (centre of the 7-pin header row) on the board
# surface. Units: mm.
